Package: Friedman
Title: Tools for Exploring and Modeling Airline Delay Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Miguel", "Andion", email = "mandion@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for cleaning, summarizing, visualizing,
    and modeling airline delay data. The package is designed to support
    exploratory analysis and prediction of flight delay patterns using
    airport, airline, and time-based features for academic and project
    work.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports: 
    dplyr,
    rlang
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/mandion928/Friedman
BugReports: https://github.com/mandion928/Friedman/issues
Suggests: 
    testthat,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
